Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Signs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.33,0:00:06.78,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning, Fujimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.78,0:00:08.94,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.20,0:00:13.44,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Do you know what time it is right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.44,0:00:14.36,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.13,0:00:19.34,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,And yet every morning... what is it today?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.34,0:00:21.94,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm here to help out today as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.01,0:00:26.08,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Please let me help you, Fujimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.50,0:00:28.08,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Jeez... you know—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.08,0:00:28.71,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.54,0:00:32.24,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning, Kobato, Fujimoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.24,0:00:33.90,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.40,0:00:35.73,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Are you helping him out today too?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.73,0:00:36.87,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.00,0:00:40.47,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure you're a big help!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.47,0:00:44.73,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Quit joking around. Why does she have to help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.12,0:00:47.98,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, don't let up on him, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.65,0:00:52.95,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,It seems like Fujimoto would overwork himself from the moment he's left alone after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.78,0:00:54.74,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.53,0:02:31.08,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Man, every single day...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.33,0:02:38.51,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I can do it myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.13,0:02:41.27,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.27,0:02:45.01,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I found this. I'll hang it over here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.01,0:02:45.95,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.95,0:02:46.64,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Don't do things without asking first!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.67,0:02:54.80,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What else should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.19,0:03:01.52,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Where are you going today?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.26,0:03:05.88,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yesterday you went to the library, and the day before to the university!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.74,0:03:07.97,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,To work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.47,0:03:11.27,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I thought you had off from work?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.36,0:03:15.48,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know how many times I've said this already, but if you're doing this—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.48,0:03:17.88,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not doing this out of sympathy or curiosity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.75,0:03:21.39,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I've also told you that this annoys me, haven't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.10,0:03:26.40,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Have you taken a walk before, Fujimoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.75,0:03:27.76,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.53,0:03:31.37,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It's good to take walks! It's fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.84,0:03:33.10,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What's fun is...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.89,0:03:35.60,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,You're the only one who thinks so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.85,0:03:37.73,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.00,0:03:39.14,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go somewhere fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.77,0:03:40.66,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.74,0:03:45.16,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,That's right. They went out together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.34,0:03:49.27,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.39,0:03:53.84,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,No matter who you are, time is the key for something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.91,0:03:57.75,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Like it was for the two of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.71,0:03:59.23,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.50,0:04:13.88,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Why are we doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.85,0:04:18.60,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.09,0:04:23.77,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Because your right here, Fujimoto, is always all scrunched up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.29,0:04:28.93,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,So I want you to enjoy yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.35,0:04:34.19,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, look at the boats!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.19,0:04:36.27,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto, let's get on a boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.17,0:04:38.63,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, a boat?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.25,0:04:41.23,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.29,0:04:48.95,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It costs money...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.39,0:04:54.17,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Row!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.23,0:04:56.07,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Row!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.96,0:04:57.81,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Row!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.86,0:05:03.46,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.96,0:05:05.91,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,We're going to crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.42,0:05:13.40,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Switch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.40,0:05:15.10,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,No, we can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.10,0:05:16.50,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You're injured!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.81,0:05:19.70,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,If you keep doing it, we're never going to get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.44,0:05:23.02,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Never going to...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.42,0:05:29.08,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.08,0:05:30.67,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'll do my best to row!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.24,0:05:42.38,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Don't put the oars in too deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.38,0:05:43.02,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.65,0:05:45.14,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Use your legs too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.14,0:05:46.22,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.22,0:05:47.21,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.66,0:05:50.63,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,We're moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.63,0:05:52.42,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,This is so amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.96,0:05:54.62,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,You are so happy-go-lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.58,0:05:58.77,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.48,0:06:00.12,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.64,0:06:03.64,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It's gotten a little better here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.09,0:06:11.73,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What's the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.73,0:06:17.32,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Well, in order to make Fujimoto feel better, this time I've bought fish food to—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.32,0:06:18.64,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,That's not what I mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.64,0:06:21.11,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Do you know what sort of situation you're in right now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.11,0:06:25.78,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! I've made Fujimoto spend money again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.78,0:06:27.87,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But I made sure to get the right amount of change back—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.85,0:06:34.50,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,That's not what I'm talking about! How many times do I need to say this? You're out of time!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.50,0:06:37.50,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Right, that's why I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.09,0:06:42.61,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Let's hurry back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.89,0:06:46.07,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! I'm not done talking yet— Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.12,0:06:53.13,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Here fishy, fishy! Here's some food!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.57,0:06:55.13,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.30,0:06:58.30,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Would you like some too, Fujimoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.30,0:07:00.07,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Please just leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.39,0:07:04.94,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I can't calm down with you always around me like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.19,0:07:11.68,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.90,0:07:22.42,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,All right, let's get going, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.42,0:07:25.15,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,If we don't even collect one more konpeito—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.15,0:07:26.17,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, look here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.57,0:07:29.73,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.08,0:07:32.47,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Man, it was only you, Kohaku?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.92,0:07:34.53,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Are you out on a walk?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.53,0:07:37.07,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,The weather is beautiful today!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.63,0:07:40.83,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What the heck is up with this happy-happy mood?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.83,0:07:42.31,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Is it not okay to be happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.31,0:07:45.87,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Kohaku! Talk to your fellow happy-\Nhappy cheerleader, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.87,0:07:47.28,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,To Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.28,0:07:53.62,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! Forgetting her wish and \Nflouncing about all happy-happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.62,0:07:55.37,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I haven't forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.37,0:07:56.49,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.18,0:08:01.38,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I haven't forgotten. I've decided on my wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.81,0:08:06.16,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Well, of course you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.30,0:08:46.25,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What the heck is up with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.01,0:08:48.64,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.00,0:08:51.50,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Are you angry, Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.50,0:08:53.34,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.62,0:08:59.89,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I am angry with her, but when she looks at me with such resolution in eyes...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.55,0:09:03.11,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato has chosen, hasn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.77,0:09:05.26,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Idiot girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.45,0:09:09.16,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Everything that happens is inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.88,0:09:13.14,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,And so nothing is ever meaningless.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.06,0:09:16.03,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Is that true only for the heavenly world?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.34,0:09:19.31,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Can that be said for those of the spirit world as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.37,0:09:24.75,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,It applies to all beings.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.41,0:09:27.50,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.92,0:09:35.04,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.76,0:09:40.06,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank goodness. I was able to find you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.56,0:09:42.69,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.29,0:09:43.80,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.71,0:09:46.44,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Why do you concern yourself with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.28,0:09:48.86,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Why do I... 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.73,0:09:51.38,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,So I'll be grateful to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.28,0:09:53.84,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,If so, you've got the wrong guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.27,0:09:56.48,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I don't really feel grateful for this or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.12,0:09:58.75,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I won't think anything of it after it's over either.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.48,0:10:05.13,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Because you're an important person to me, Fujimoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.55,0:10:11.15,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It's natural to be concerned about those important to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.55,0:10:18.42,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka has the organ for safekeeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.56,0:10:21.07,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Whatever, doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.02,0:10:25.59,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That organ is important to you, isn't it, Fujimoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.77,0:10:28.99,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You can go and play it again whenever you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.98,0:10:34.00,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.16,0:10:38.99,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I was just thinking that you and Ioryogi are so alike!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.99,0:10:41.19,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Like how you two are always angry and such.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.87,0:10:45.14,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi is that stuffed animal you're always carrying around, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.14,0:10:50.59,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! But he's really an extremely nice person.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.59,0:10:54.12,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I suppose we should get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.75,0:10:56.01,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, I suppose so.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.60,0:10:58.30,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Kohaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.81,0:10:59.30,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.96,0:11:02.01,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You chose as well, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.38,0:11:04.36,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Are you happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.74,0:11:07.20,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.11,0:11:13.35,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, what about your laundry?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.96,0:11:17.35,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Hanging up the laundry is difficult, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.63,0:11:18.23,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I could—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.61,0:11:48.70,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.85,0:11:51.88,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.90,0:11:55.02,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I can't be with you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.36,0:12:00.16,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Well, isn't that great. I'll finally be free.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.96,0:12:05.55,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,As long as you're happy, Fujimoto, I'm happy too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.26,0:12:34.21,Default,Nurse,0000,0000,0000,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.07,0:12:36.55,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.20,0:12:41.60,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I see. This is rather sudden, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.60,0:12:43.78,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for taking care of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.78,0:12:47.21,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted to say goodbye to Chiho and Chise as well but... 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.88,0:12:49.56,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure they'll miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.70,0:12:51.92,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,What about Sayaka?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.45,0:12:54.70,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm planning on going to see her now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.69,0:12:56.76,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.23,0:13:03.24,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,It's already been a year since you came here, hasn't it, Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.80,0:13:12.69,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, spring and summer and fall and winter, all four seasons have passed. It's been a wonderful time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.70,0:13:17.20,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Once you're settled again, give me a call, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.39,0:13:20.28,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.62,0:13:21.94,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Once I'm settled...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.41,0:13:32.15,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I've decided on my wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.96,0:13:40.38,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey Dobato, you know what that means, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.51,0:13:42.09,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.09,0:13:44.54,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't gather the rest of the konpeito, you'll—! {i know you said not to use these but it looks really funny with just an !}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.23,0:13:50.56,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You don't care what happens to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.44,0:13:56.81,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Are you stupid or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.62,0:13:59.32,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I may be, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.10,0:14:02.28,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.58,0:14:05.67,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,A full, 100 point idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.10,0:14:15.70,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi! I'm sorry for the wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.42,0:14:18.07,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Have you made your farewells?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.88,0:14:19.72,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.69,0:14:24.52,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Shall we go then?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.02,0:14:25.73,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.18,0:14:43.46,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Jeez, he's still not back yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.64,0:14:47.87,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I suppose things are okay like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.18,0:14:56.82,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Look how bright the moon is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.59,0:14:58.58,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.02,0:15:02.58,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.95,0:15:05.08,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What is it, Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.31,0:15:11.28,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Is it painful to do nothing but stay by someone's side?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.80,0:15:13.29,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Painful?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.79,0:15:15.09,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Why would it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.96,0:15:23.87,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Just being able to stay by someone's side... that itself is a wonderful thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.93,0:15:39.27,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,I thought that you definitely would've known about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.27,0:15:40.17,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,No, I... 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.04,0:15:44.56,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,It must've been hard for Kobato to say, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.94,0:15:47.86,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Where did she say she was going?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.18,0:15:51.83,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,She only said that she'd call after she got settled in...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.24,0:15:55.47,Default,C&C,0000,0000,0000,,There he goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.87,0:16:15.70,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,She's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.72,0:16:38.21,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Now you wait just a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.21,0:16:39.44,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.44,0:16:40.81,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,She worked really hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.81,0:16:42.98,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,She's a little dumb and clumsy and silly,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.98,0:16:45.94,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,and her only redeeming characteristics are her cheerfulness and honesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.94,0:16:50.08,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,but that's just perfect for a human! She really has a wonderful soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.52,0:16:53.08,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,So please, don't get rid of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.58,0:16:57.42,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't... get rid of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.68,0:17:03.71,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi, you're making things difficult for Ushagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.83,0:17:14.56,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.55,0:17:20.02,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Please don't apologize. This is something that I decided on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.73,0:17:22.93,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.19,0:17:27.22,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Ioryogi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.15,0:17:47.49,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.41,0:17:50.01,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto... 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.55,0:17:56.18,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Where are you planning on going?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.66,0:17:58.97,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.46,0:18:00.51,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Are you messing with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.61,0:18:03.65,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,In the end, I've made you angry again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.03,0:18:05.41,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Of course you have!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.41,0:18:08.48,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Disappearing without saying a word! What are up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.48,0:18:09.78,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.87,0:18:14.15,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Did what I said upset you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.15,0:18:16.62,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,No! It's not that at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.90,0:18:17.83,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Then why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.34,0:18:22.62,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Because of her contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.97,0:18:24.50,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.88,0:18:26.47,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.47,0:18:27.80,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,On top of the luggage.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.93,0:18:30.69,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.03,0:18:34.69,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,This is Ioryogi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.53,0:18:38.00,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,That's... a stuffed animal...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.57,0:18:40.50,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Just pretending to be one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.91,0:18:45.99,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,We were talking about the contract, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.95,0:18:48.53,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, show him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.36,0:18:52.02,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.23,0:18:55.46,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,H-Hey, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.36,0:19:02.22,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,You're... what is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.96,0:19:05.53,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,She's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.67,0:19:11.11,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato's soul right now doesn't belong to any world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.82,0:19:14.46,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,She's an unliving, ambiguous existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.54,0:19:23.10,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,But because of a contract with someone up there, she was given one chance to be reborn and relive her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.10,0:19:25.35,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, what are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.78,0:19:26.58,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.81,0:19:32.48,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato chose to spend her remaining time with you instead of fulfilling her contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.48,0:19:38.09,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,And accordingly, broke it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.51,0:19:48.70,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That's why I have no choice but to disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.92,0:19:52.13,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,You're joking, right?! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.35,0:19:57.87,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I was happy to be able to stay by your side, Fujimoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.56,0:20:07.91,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I can't do it, can I... I wanted to leave with a smile on my face in the end... 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.32,0:20:17.93,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Stop! Please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.27,0:20:25.83,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You're my most important person, Fujimoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.73,0:20:28.61,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Up until now...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.46,0:20:33.95,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,From now on... till the end of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.05,0:20:36.58,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.47,0:21:03.73,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Konpeito?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.16,0:21:11.11,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.46,0:21:18.96,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,The konpeito... are accumulating.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.15,0:21:28.29,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato's wish has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.79,0:21:32.80,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,But the contract cannot be changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.21,0:21:36.32,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,The contract to reach the place she wished to go to... 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.76,0:21:41.82,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto's konpeito...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.84,0:21:43.83,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It's so warm...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.53,0:21:46.96,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,That's just like a curse now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.39,0:21:51.70,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Please! Reincarnate Kobato into this world!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.64,0:22:01.62,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.21,0:22:05.07,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry that I wasn't able to do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.08,0:22:14.48,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't apologize. I wasn't either, even though I was with her the longest.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.27,0:22:20.29,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,But if everything that happens is inevitable, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.19,0:22:23.67,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.94,0:22:28.45,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I must go to the place I should be at.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.95,0:22:32.17,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.97,0:01:03.78,Title Screen,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(300,0)\pos(340,90)}Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.78,0:01:11.45,Title Screen,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,500)\t(\fscy140\fscx120)\move(340,90,340,45)}Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.02,0:01:06.63,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}How do I do this again?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.92,0:01:11.22,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}The simplest things in life
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.25,0:01:15.23,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}end up being the most difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.46,0:01:18.03,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I just want to smile when I'm happy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.30,0:01:25.37,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}and sing a song whenever I please.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.79,0:01:30.95,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I was told, "Someday,\Nyour dream will come true."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.74,0:01:34.79,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}But when exactly will that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.96,0:01:38.33,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I can't wait that long!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.58,0:01:41.39,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I spread my arms
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.53,0:01:44.13,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}on the count of one two three
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.38,0:01:49.38,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}and gather all the light in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.56,0:01:52.19,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.20,0:01:55.78,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}isn't there something I can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.81,0:01:58.54,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Even if someone hurts my feelings,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.61,0:02:01.28,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I'll keep running toward the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.51,0:02:08.16,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Even if I trip, fall, and cry my eyes out, I still believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.45,0:02:12.17,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Although it may seem silly...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.98,0:02:16.82,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I believe in tomorrow.
