Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.13,0:03:01.19,Episode Titles,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fsp2\fad(800,800)\pos(365,195)\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}...Kobato's Wish.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.13,0:03:01.19,Episode Titles,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fsp2\fad(800,800)\bord1.6\pos(360,190)}...Kobato's Wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.13,0:23:12.13,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\be1\org(0,0)}Your smile falls in that space
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.87,0:23:20.39,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\be1\org(0,0)}between the things I've lost and the things I've gained.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.58,0:23:26.39,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\be1\org(0,0)}It seems as if I could reach it, but I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.18,0:23:31.84,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\be1\org(0,0)}It's not as if I can fly...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.14,0:23:38.44,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\be1\org(0,0)}Even though I only wanted to make you smile...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.24,0:23:49.39,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\be1\org(0,0)}What purpose do they serve, these useless wings of mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.16,0:24:00.37,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\be1\org(0,0)}All I can do is smile by your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.01,0:24:07.42,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\be1\org(0,0)}I wonder if it's okay to only warm your heart
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.50,0:24:12.24,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\be1\org(0,0)}when, at the very least, I want to envelop you in warmth.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.66,0:24:19.73,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\be1\org(0,0)}Have you noticed? I want to embrace you with my wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.53,0:24:27.87,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\be1\org(0,0)}And now, I am able to smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.08,0:24:29.97,Episode Titles,,0000,0000,0000,,{\bord1.5\be1\fs25\fad(400,0)\c&H111111&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(434,252)}Next
